# ACME WIDGETS INC.

<center>**Unanimous Written Consent of the Board of Directors**</center>

The undersigned, being all of the directors of Acme Widgets Inc., a Delaware corporation (the **"Company"**), adopt the following resolutions by written consent effective as of [Effective Date].

## 1. Approval of the Widget Plan

RESOLVED, that the Widget Plan in the form presented to the Board is *approved and adopted*.

(a) The Widget Plan reserves [Number] shares of Common Stock for issuance.

(b) The officers may amend the Widget Plan to correct [scrivener's errors [and omissions]].

## 2. Issuance of Shares

RESOLVED, that the Company issue shares of Common Stock to the persons listed below:

| Holder | Shares | Price per share |
|---|---|---|
| [Holder One] | 1,000 | $0.001 |
| [Holder Two] | 2,500 | $0.001 |

> The officers may execute any certificate, instrument or notice described in these resolutions.

## 3. General Authority

RESOLVED, that each officer is authorized to take any action necessary to carry out these resolutions.\
This consent may be signed in counterparts.

